---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Create — Open Bible Stories" description="Build your own text, image, audio, or video resource from Open Bible Stories." active="create">

<section class="page-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Share the Gospel through multimedia resources</p>
    <h1>Create</h1>
    <p>Create your own resource based on unfoldingWord&reg; Open Bible Stories or the original Sweet Publishing images &mdash; whatever helps the people you serve encounter these stories.</p>
    <p class="possibility-line">Videos &middot; Audio &middot; Training material &middot; Presentations &middot; Children's resources &middot; Social media &middot; Teaching material</p>
    <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top:28px;">
      <a href="/discover/" class="btn btn-primary">Find your language</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Text</h2>
      <p>The easiest way to get started is Scribe SE, a free translation tool for Windows, Mac, or Linux.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid cols-2">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Scribe SE</h3>
        <p>Start translating from English or one of the other languages listed on Discover.</p>
        <a href="https://scribe.bible/" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top:14px;">Download Scribe SE</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Other options</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://cdn.door43.org/en/obs/v6/obs.zip" style="color:var(--inspire-text);">English markdown source</a> for a plaintext or markdown editor</li>
          <li><a href="https://cdn.door43.org/en/obs/v6/docx/en_obs-v6.docx" style="color:var(--inspire-text);">Microsoft Word</a> or <a href="https://cdn.door43.org/en/obs/v6/odt/en_obs-v6.odt" style="color:var(--inspire-text);">OpenDocument</a> from English</li>
          <li><a href="https://bloomlibrary.org/browse/detail/2nbAvDqoQJ" style="color:var(--inspire-text);">Bloom Editor</a> from English</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stats-section">
  <div class="wrap stats-inner">
    <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:32px;">
      <h2>Images</h2>
      <p>Source illustrations for building your own documents, slides, or translated story sets.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid cols-2">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>JPG files</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://filedn.com/lD0GfuMvTstXgqaJfpLL87S/obs/jpg/obs-images-2160px.zip" style="color:var(--inspire-text);">All files, 2160px</a> (769 MB)</li>
          <li><a href="https://filedn.com/lD0GfuMvTstXgqaJfpLL87S/obs/jpg/obs-images-360px.zip" style="color:var(--inspire-text);">All files, 360px</a> (36 MB)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Original illustrations</h3>
        <p>Browse or download the original illustrations from Sweet Publishing on the <a href="https://www.unfoldingword.org/sweet-publishing/" style="color:var(--inspire-text);">unfoldingWord website</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Videos &amp; Audio</h2>
      <p>HD 1080p video clips for building your own Open Bible Stories videos or audio recordings in any editor.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid cols-2">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>MP4 files</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://filedn.com/lD0GfuMvTstXgqaJfpLL87S/obs/mp4/obs_1080p_stock%20clips_master.zip" style="color:var(--inspire-text);">All files zipped</a> (7.2 GB)</li>
          <li><a href="https://filedn.com/lD0GfuMvTstXgqaJfpLL87S/obs/mp4/obs_1080p_clips_stories_01-10.zip" style="color:var(--inspire-text);">Stories 1&ndash;10</a> (1.5 GB)</li>
          <li><a href="https://filedn.com/lD0GfuMvTstXgqaJfpLL87S/obs/mp4/obs_1080p_clips_stories_11-20.zip" style="color:var(--inspire-text);">Stories 11&ndash;20</a> (1.7 GB)</li>
          <li><a href="https://filedn.com/lD0GfuMvTstXgqaJfpLL87S/obs/mp4/obs_1080p_clips_stories_21-30.zip" style="color:var(--inspire-text);">Stories 21&ndash;30</a> (1.2 GB)</li>
          <li><a href="https://filedn.com/lD0GfuMvTstXgqaJfpLL87S/obs/mp4/obs_1080p_clips_stories_31-40.zip" style="color:var(--inspire-text);">Stories 31&ndash;40</a> (1.3 GB)</li>
          <li><a href="https://filedn.com/lD0GfuMvTstXgqaJfpLL87S/obs/mp4/obs_1080p_clips_stories_41-50.zip" style="color:var(--inspire-text);">Stories 41&ndash;50</a> (1.5 GB)</li>
          <li><a href="https://filedn.com/lD0GfuMvTstXgqaJfpLL87S/obs/mp4/stories/" style="color:var(--inspire-text);">Individual story files</a> (about 150 MB each)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>PSD files</h3>
        <p>For significant edits to visual elements within the clips. Large files that require photo-editing software and skill to use.</p>
        <a href="https://filedn.com/lD0GfuMvTstXgqaJfpLL87S/obs/psd/" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top:14px;">Individual story PSD files</a>
        <p style="margin-top:14px; font-size:0.88rem;">Need help producing a video or audio recording? <a href="https://unfoldingword.org/contact/" style="color:var(--inspire-text);">Contact us</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Base>
